---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Medication Questions & What to Expect | MWRS"
  description="Answers to common questions about psychiatric medication at MWRS — including when to reach out, what to expect early on, how refills work, and when to schedule a follow-up."
>
  <main class="medq-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="subpage-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1>Medication Questions & What to Expect</h1>
        <p>
          Medication is one part of your care, and it's completely normal to
          have questions between visits. This page is here to help you know
          when to reach out, what's worth a message, and what can wait for
          your next appointment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- When to reach out -->
    <section class="medq-body">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>When to reach out between visits</h2>
          <p>You don't need to wait until your next appointment for everything. It's fine to contact us for:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Refill requests (see below for how that works)</li>
            <li>Clarification on instructions from your last visit</li>
            <li>Scheduling questions or follow-up appointments</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For clinical questions — like side effects, timing, or whether it's
            okay to take something alongside your medication — the trusted
            resources below are a good first stop. For anything that needs a
            direct answer from your provider, the best path is to schedule a
            follow-up appointment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>Trusted resources</h2>
          <p>These free tools can help answer common questions about your medication between visits:</p>
          <div class="medq-resource-cards">
            <a href="https://www.drugs.com/drug_interactions.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="medq-resource-card">
              <span class="medq-resource-source">Drugs.com</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-title">Interaction Checker & Side Effects</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-desc">Check how medications interact and look up side effects for free.</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-cta">Visit resource →</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/mental-illness/in-depth/mental-health-medications/art-20364707" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="medq-resource-card">
              <span class="medq-resource-source">Mayo Clinic</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-title">Mental Health Medications Overview</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-desc">Plain-language overview of psychiatric medications and how they work.</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-cta">Visit resource →</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/treatments/24291-psychiatric-medications" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="medq-resource-card">
              <span class="medq-resource-source">Cleveland Clinic</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-title">Psychiatric Medications</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-desc">What to expect from common psychiatric medications, explained clearly.</span>
              <span class="medq-resource-cta">Visit resource →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>When to schedule a follow-up</h2>
          <p>Some things are better handled in an appointment than over a message. Schedule a follow-up if:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your medication doesn't seem to be helping after giving it time</li>
            <li>Your symptoms are getting worse or changing</li>
            <li>You want to adjust your dosage or try something different</li>
            <li>You're dealing with something new that feels connected to your mental health</li>
            <li>You have side effects that are affecting your daily life</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            When in doubt, it's always okay to reach out and ask — we can help
            you figure out whether a message or an appointment makes more sense.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>What to expect early on</h2>
          <p>
            Starting a new medication — or adjusting one — can feel uncertain.
            A few things worth knowing:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Many psychiatric medications take 2–4 weeks (sometimes longer) to reach their full effect</li>
            <li>Mild side effects like fatigue, headache, or nausea are common in the first week or two and often settle on their own</li>
            <li>Not every medication works the same for every person — finding the right fit sometimes takes a few adjustments</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            If something feels concerning or you're not sure whether what you're
            experiencing is normal, reach out. It's always better to ask.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>How refills work</h2>
          <p>
            Refill requests are reviewed each day during set administrative time — not in real time. Here's what to expect:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>We respond to refill requests within 1–2 business days with an updated status</li>
            <li>That update may include confirmation that your refill was sent, or a note that a follow-up appointment is needed first</li>
            <li>Please don't wait until you're out — plan ahead so there's time to process your request</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="medq-callout">
            <strong>Running low before the weekend?</strong> If you submit a
            refill request and it may not be processed in time, your pharmacist
            may be able to provide a short-term emergency supply to bridge the
            gap. Ask your pharmacy about this option.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Refill CTA card -->
        <div class="medq-refill-card">
          <div>
            <p class="medq-refill-kicker">Existing Patients</p>
            <p class="medq-refill-title">Ready to request a refill?</p>
            <p class="medq-refill-text">Submit your request online and we'll follow up within 1–2 business days.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/medication-refill" class="btn-outline btn-outline--medication medq-refill-btn">
            Request a refill →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block">
          <h2>How to contact our office</h2>
          <p>
            You can reach us by phone or through the patient portal. Our admin
            team receives all incoming messages and routes them appropriately —
            so even if your message doesn't go straight to your provider, it
            will get to the right person.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:2082612255">208.261.2255</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            For non-urgent questions, messaging through the portal is often the
            fastest way to get a response.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="medq-block medq-block--urgent">
          <h2>Urgent or emergency situations</h2>
          <p>
            If you're experiencing a medical emergency, severe allergic
            reaction, or any situation that feels unsafe — call 911 or go to
            your nearest emergency room. Please don't wait for a callback.
          </p>
          <p>If you're in a mental health crisis or having thoughts of suicide or self-harm:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Call or text 988</strong> — Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, available 24/7</li>
            <li><strong>North Idaho Crisis Center:</strong> <a href="tel:2086643337">208.664.3337</a> — available 24/7 for North Idaho residents</li>
            <li>You can also go to your nearest emergency room</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            MWRS is not a crisis service. These resources are here to support
            you when you need more than we can provide between appointments.
          </p>
        </div>



      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="medq-cta">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
        <p>
          Reach out and we'll point you in the right direction — whether that's
          answering your question directly or helping you schedule time with
          your provider.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--medication">
          Contact our office
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .medq-page {
      background: #f9fafb;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .subpage-hero {
      padding: 10rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #8ab4a4 !important;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .subpage-hero h1 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .subpage-hero p {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 640px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Shared section wrapper ───────────────────────── */
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── Body ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .medq-body {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #e5e9f3;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .medq-block {
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }

    .medq-block:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .medq-block h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      color: #6a9e8e;
    }

    .medq-block p {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .medq-block p a {
      color: #6a9e8e;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.4);
    }

    .medq-block p a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: #6a9e8e;
    }

    .medq-block ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .medq-block li + li {
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .medq-block ul a {
      color: #6a9e8e;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.4);
    }

    .medq-block ul a:hover {
      border-bottom-color: #6a9e8e;
    }

    /* Callout box — weekend refill tip */
    .medq-callout {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-left: 3px solid #8ab4a4;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem !important;
      color: #374151 !important;
    }

    /* Urgent block — slightly warmer background */
    .medq-block--urgent {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(138, 180, 164, 0.5);
    }

    /* ── Resource cards ───────────────────────────────── */
    .medq-resource-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .medq-resource-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(138, 180, 164, 0.5);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
      transition: box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .medq-resource-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.15);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .medq-resource-source {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8ab4a4;
    }

    .medq-resource-title {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: #111827;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .medq-resource-desc {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      color: #6b7280;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }

    .medq-resource-cta {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #6a9e8e;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.4);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
    }

    .medq-resource-card:hover .medq-resource-cta {
      border-bottom-color: #6a9e8e;
    }

    /* ── Refill CTA card ──────────────────────────────── */
    .medq-refill-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(138, 180, 164, 0.6);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.1);
    }

    .medq-refill-kicker {
      margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8ab4a4;
    }

    .medq-refill-title {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .medq-refill-text {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #4b5563;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .medq-refill-btn {
      white-space: nowrap;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .medq-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.webp");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .medq-cta h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .medq-cta p {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Outline button ───────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
        box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline--medication {
      border-color: #6a9e8e;
      color: #6a9e8e;
    }

    .btn-outline--medication:hover {
      background: #6a9e8e;
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(106, 158, 142, 0.3);
    }
    /* CSS */
/* Override global lavender dividers — sage on this page */
:global(.subpage-hero) {
  border-bottom-color: #6a9e8e !important;
}

:global(.site-footer) {
  border-top-color: #6a9e8e !important;
}
  </style>
</Layout>